Phase 1 - Define candidate and filter contracts
    ✔ Add a SoulSearchCandidateProvider contract with get_units() returning df.unit[] or nil plus an optional error. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Add descriptor behavior metadata with the explicit values candidate and ranking. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Mark existing attribute, trait, and skill descriptors as ranking descriptors. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Add filter-state projections for get_candidate_filters() and get_ranking_filters() without exposing mutable internal tables. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Keep the serialized selected-filter shape as ordered {id, direction} entries for preset compatibility. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Update module registration and lifecycle cache-reset contracts for each new production module. @done(26-07-12; candidate_provider is stateless and needs no reset hook)
    Phase gate
        ✔ Contract tests prove candidate and ranking projections preserve validation, direction, and relative order. @done(26-07-12)
        ✔ Existing ranking and preset tests remain unchanged and green. @done(26-07-12; 138 tests, 0 failures)

