    ✔ Implement all_active from active, alive map units and preserve source order. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Implement fort_residents from DFHack resident classification, including the intended insane-resident behavior. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Implement citizens_and_pets as the default from fort-controlled citizens and tame/owned animals without duplicate units. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Keep scope selection injectable but non-user-facing in this feature. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Propagate unloaded-map and non-fortress-mode errors without returning partial candidates. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Expand the test environment with active-unit vectors and DFHack citizenship, residency, fort-control, tame, pet, alive, and active predicates. @done(26-07-12)
    Phase gate
        ✔ Provider tests distinguish citizens, tame animals, residents, visitors, wildlife, hostiles, inactive units, and dead units. @done(26-07-12)
